ors, and non-fossil fuel generators and sales of genuine spare parts and components; commercial vehicle operates a dedicated authorised service centre, a network of transporters, fleet operators, and logistics hubs; and two-wheeler, operates an authorised dealership and service centre for a renowned automobile manufacturer. The Logistics and Equipment Rental Services segment operate as the construction equipment rental fleets catering to renowned infrastructure giants. It provides end-to-end concrete transportation and supply, equipment rental services for residential, commercial, and public infrastructure projects, and consists a fleet comprising 92 transit mixers, 13 concrete pumps, and 23 Logistics Trucks. The company was founded in 2009 and is based in Gurugram, India.","employees":192,"earnDates":[],"exDiv":null,"asOf":1795530097},"analyst":null,"cap":"Penny","caFix":null,"fetched":1795530097,"source":"Yahoo Finance (public chart, fundamentals-timeseries & quoteSummary endpoints)","news":{"q":"\"Paluck Technologies\" stock when:90d","items":[{"t":"Paluck Technologies Ltd. Share Price Today - Paluck Technologies Ltd. Stock Price Live NSE/BSE","s":"CNBC TV18","d":1795168740,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxPS0NWcVZHUU5fZ3JGLVl2d05jS1J5TnJfR0czOEZkVV9fTkttMVVUVnJyVVdrclZDelJzQ1o2X3BQZkpNN3ktd0NGN0tXZ3dFQlV3YkFKOVZWaWhKSnNxa2w3cHFKX0lIZ21IejRBelBmMWdZclZKQ1hIOTloZjdBT2ZsMGxoXzRtZEE?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Paluck Technologies Limited Share Price","s":"Upstox","d":1795161600,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidEFVX3lxTE5Lbm9mb1RnTnhOMzZCaTVfenRDMHBsYWhneElEei1pSE1iLThaNE1oSlhRZFpVTGJ0RUgyeUwzWlpPMTFwQmdzMFotc2NuZTk5NUIxY29nUWsyNko1aDV2cVJVNm1vYVJoWGRKRExaVHBxb0hl?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Paluck Technologies Ltd Q1 Results","s":"Livemint","d":1793952000,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxQZ0FqaExyc3ExWG4ySnBqa1FwaVBzVkthSTFKcjNzeERoYUc0OVRIVzZsSGdpSG56TVB5dDdEaFlvU21HczMwVVU2Nk91NGVqV2VsWXhGNTI3eF80ZFU5OWdLMmhnOWo1dzNwVF